comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-06T05:48:07.109Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-09-06: strict complete all-status export of 2649 items found no GH-1207 owner. Request-specific search and open/in-progress reads were checked. Full live pm-larv4r metadata and verified history confirm its completed finding-severity scope. This new report arrived during PR 1208 review and is recorded open and unclaimed."
  "2026-09-06T10:05:58.957Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: isolated Git tracker reproduced absent invocation authority and advisory per-check disagreement. Current strict-exit uses generic failure code 1 and requires missing merge drivers; the report quoted exit 2 from a different invocation. Preserve current blocking/advisory policy and expose it explicitly rather than silently promoting all advisory warnings. Delivery combines pm-7c27ep recurrence enforcement and pm-du93sr diagnostic budget proof."
  "2026-09-06T10:54:15.064Z","harness:codex","Manual packed-consumer acceptance passed in an isolated temporary npm installation: CLI recurs_from mutations, bounded lineage paging, SDK inherited risk checks, explicit unknown classification, and matching strict SDK/CLI health predicates and exit receipts. Separate npm/npx/bunx tarball smoke passed with 13 installed extension packages and SDK type consumption."
  "2026-09-06T11:26:05.093Z","harness:codex","Delivery verification: all 627 test files and 8495 tests pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage (62860 statements, 47727 branches, 13015 functions, 60407 lines). Real advisory storage fixtures and strict merge-driver failures agree across SDK and CLI projections. Packed SDK/CLI acceptance also passes under Bun, alongside npm/npx/bunx consumer smokes. Import-cost gates pass when rerun without concurrent coverage load; no ceilings or coverage thresholds were changed. Implementation is ready for reviewed delivery; hosted PR and release proof remain separate."
  "2026-09-06T12:56:27.311Z","harness:codex","Review correction: strictExit help now follows the actual health, validation, history, extension and package doctor semantics in action-scoped schemas. Focused contract and transport tests pass; final coverage will run on the combined review correction head."
  "2026-09-06T13:49:07.109Z","harness:codex","Final review-correction evidence: 628 files and 8502 tests pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage and zero uncovered counts; complete pnpm quality:static and typecheck pass. The final packed artifact passes fresh Node and Bun SDK/CLI acceptance, including strict health parity, inherited risk, normalized dependency/file references, invalid lineage request refusal, and zero-byte tracker source refusal. Hosted CI and review of the next head remain merge prerequisites."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-06T10:54:12.419Z","harness:codex",A warning status describes diagnostic severity; the check and invocation booleans must derive from blocking findings under the same invocation policy. Keep strict policy metadata next to the deciding predicate so transports cannot invent incompatible verdicts.
